{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33938","headline":"鲁望以花翁之什见招因次韵詶之 · 皮日休","name":"鲁望以花翁之什见招因次韵詶之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九十携锄伛偻翁，小园幽事尽能通。\n斸烟栽药爲身计，负水浇花是世功。\n婚嫁定期杉叶紫，盖藏应待桂枝红。\n不知家道能多少，只在句芒一夜风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33938.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33938","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}